 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Sky Manipulation — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have created an extension technique to your sky manipulation, literally breaking the sky as if it were ice. As an action for 5 Cursed Energy, you can force every creature in a 30 feet line to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they will take a number of d10s equal to twice your Cursed Energy modifier in force damage and be knocked prone, on a success they take half as much damage and are not prone. While you are flying, all creatures make their save at disadvantage.</p>",
